  <text x="360" y="320" font-family="'Poppins', sans-serif" font-size="20" fill="#94a3b8">Crafting Cutting-Edge Web Apps, Gemini AI Integrations &amp; Glassmorphic Dark UI</text>

  <rect x="360" y="380" width="480" height="60" rx="30" fill="url(#hGlow)"/>
  <text x="600" y="418" font-family="'Space Grotesk', sans-serif" font-weight="800" font-size="20" fill="#050816" text-anchor="middle">EXPLORE FULL PORTFOLIO &amp; AI WEB SERVICES</text>
